NEARS-1934 QA — regression candidate (PRE-EXISTING, unrelated to this ticket)
"Best Reviewed Items" rail does not render on the Food home in ZONE 2 (Abu Dhabi),
while it renders normally in ZONE 1.

Observed: 2026-08-15, UserApp debug build, emulator-5556, worktree
/Users/Apple/Projects/nears-NEARS-1934-food-hours (branch feat/NEARS-1934-food-hours).
Account customer@nears.com, delivery address "Abu Dhabi - United Arab Emirates" (zone 2).
Device clock 23:30 (NEARS-1934 fixture APPLIED, so the module gate was open and the
full rail stack was rendering).

WHY THIS IS NOT CAUSED BY NEARS-1934
NEARS-1934 changes only store_schedule opening/closing times for stores 39 and 49.
The Best Reviewed rail's contents are time-independent, and the SAME fixture state in
zone 1 renders the rail correctly. Trading hours cannot select this rail's data.

--- 1. ZONE 1 (control): rail renders ---
Section titles captured on the zone-1 Food home at device clock 23:35:
  Best Reviewed Items      <-- PRESENT
  Most Popular Items
with items: Classic Cheeseburger 4.5 (40) 9 AED, Fresh Lemonade 4.3 (21) 30 AED

