Sweep validity (each step is one full uiautomator viewport dump):
  step a:  78 labels; MostPopular=0; BestRev=0
  step b:  56 labels; MostPopular=0; BestRev=0
  step c:  45 labels; MostPopular=0; BestRev=0
  step d: 106 labels; MostPopular=1; BestRev=0
  step e:  66 labels; MostPopular=0; BestRev=0
  step f:  63 labels; MostPopular=0; BestRev=0

Positive control on the sweep — section titles it DID capture in zone 2:
  Buy It Again
  Categories
  Flash Sale
  Most Popular Items
  New on Nears
  Open Now Near You
  Popular
"Best Reviewed Items" is absent from all six. Per food_home_screen.dart section
